{
  "id": "SyncCommand",
  "title": "实例执行同步命令",
  "category": "实例管理",

  "content": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "实例执行同步命令接口。调用此 API 的前提条件是租户需要先购买实例。可以通过调用该接口实现对自己的实例进行 ADB 指令操作。\n该接口是同步操作接口，如果有耗时 ADB 操作建议使用实例执行异步命令接口。",
      "links": [],
      "images": [],
      "blocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "api-endpoint",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/instances/sync-command"
    },
    {
      "type": "api-code-panel",
      "title": "实例执行同步命令",
      "request": {
        "language": "curl",
        "code": "curl --request POST \\\n  --url https://localhost.com/v1/instances/sync-command \\\n  --header 'X-Auth-Token: <token>' \\\n  --header 'x-request-id: <request-id>' \\\n  --header 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  --data '{\n  \"command\": \"ls -l /system\",\n  \"instance_ids\": [\n    \"a44uhlf7\",\n    \"efjy72gs\"\n  ]\n}'"
      },
      "responses": [
        {
          "status": "200",
          "body": "{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"cmd_results\": [\n      {\n        \"instance_id\": \"a44uhlf7\",\n        \"status\": -1,\n        \"error_code\": \"CPS.0191\",\n        \"error_msg\": \"Run command failed.\",\n        \"execute_msg\": \"ls: cannot access '/system': No such file or directory\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"instance_id\": \"efjy72gs\",\n        \"status\": 2,\n        \"error_code\": \"\",\n        \"error_msg\": \"\",\n        \"execute_msg\": \"xxxxxx\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"error_code\": \"0\",\n  \"error_msg\": \"ok\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],

  "sections": [
    {
